<title>DENMARK: Norddeutsche Landesbank issues four pct bond.</title>
<headline>Norddeutsche Landesbank issues four pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norddeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale on Tuesday issued a four percent, three year 140 million crown bond, lead manager Dresdner Bank AG said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The issue will be sought listing on Copenhagen Bourse from December 30 this year, it said.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
